NO LICENSE GRANTED — PRE-PUBLICATION NOTICE
===========================================

Copyright (c) 2026 the cosmos3-temporal-mcq project contributors.

This repository is NOT yet licensed for use, copying, modification, or
redistribution. No license is granted, whether express or implied, by
publication of this repository.

WHY NO LICENSE HAS BEEN CHOSEN
------------------------------

This repository contains several distinct kinds of material whose rights are
not all the same, and at least one of which is not yet resolved:

1. CODE AND DOCUMENTATION (src/, scripts/, tests/, docs/, configs/, README.md,
   and the other prose files). These are original works of this project. A
   license *could* be chosen for them, but the choice is deliberately deferred
   until item 3 below is settled, because a single root LICENSE would appear to
   cover the whole repository.

2. DERIVED ANNOTATIONS (the generated multiple-choice questions and their
   metadata). These are generated from the synthetic captions of the source
   dataset. Whether they are a "derivative work" of that dataset, and what
   obligations that carries, has NOT been determined.

3. SOURCE DATASET AND UNDERLYING MEDIA. The source dataset
   (nvidia/BridgeData2-Subset-Synthetic-Captions) is released under the OpenMDW
   1.1 license. That license does NOT automatically extend to this project's
   code, to the derived annotations, or to the underlying BridgeData V2 video.
   Rights to redistribute the videos have not been established.

Applying a permissive license (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ...) to this repository
would misrepresent the rights situation, because it would purport to grant
rights over material this project may not hold. Applying a restrictive license
would be equally unfounded. Therefore no license is granted.

WHAT THIS MEANS IN PRACTICE
---------------------------

- The repository is public for INSPECTION and REVIEW only.
- Do not redistribute, reuse, or build upon it until a license is added.
- The raw dataset, prepared video trees, full annotations, caption extracts,
  and contact sheets are NOT included in this repository. See .gitignore and
  docs/dataset_provenance.md.

RESOLVING THIS
--------------

See docs/dataset_provenance.md, section 3 ("Unresolved questions"). Before
publishing or licensing, the owner must:

  a. determine whether the OpenMDW 1.1 license permits redistributing the
     derived annotations, and under what conditions;
  b. decide whether to publish the annotations at all, or only the code and
     aggregate statistics;
  c. choose a license for the code, and replace this file with it; and
  d. if a separate license is appropriate for the annotations, state it
     explicitly and scope it clearly.

Until then, this file records the absence of a license rather than inventing
one.

THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
-------------------

This project consumes, but does not redistribute, material from:

  BridgeData2 Subset Synthetic Captions
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/BridgeData2-Subset-Synthetic-Captions
    License: OpenMDW 1.1 (https://openmdw.ai/license/)
    Owner: NVIDIA Corporation

  BridgeData V2
    https://rail-berkeley.github.io/bridgedata/
    Walke et al., "BridgeData V2: A Dataset for Robot Learning at Scale",
    CoRL 2023, arXiv:2308.12952

Users who obtain the source dataset must comply with its license terms
separately. See CITATION.cff and docs/dataset_provenance.md.
